[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はー、食べた食べた！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ahh, that hit the spot!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こうして一緒に居ると、昔を思い出すね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Being together like this reminds me of old times."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん！\u3000色々やったよね。\n秘密基地を作ったりもしたっけ。楽しかったなあ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah! We did all sorts of things together. We even built that secret hideout. Those were fun times."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん……本当に楽しかった",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes... they really were."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……私、ランターナ学園に入ればよかったなあ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I wish I had gone to Lantarna Academy."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "え？\u3000どうして？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh? Why's that?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうすれば、ずっとライザと一緒に遊べたから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Then I could have spent all this time with you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あはは、確かに。今からでも転校する？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Haha, that's true. Wanna transfer? It's not too late!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なーんて。クラウディアは経営を学びたいんだもんね。\n継ぐんでしょ？\u3000お父さんの会社",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Just kidding! I know you've always wanted to study business management to take over your father's company."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どうなんだろう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm not so sure anymore."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……迷ってるの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...You're having doubts about that?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……転校して、ライザと離れ離れになった時。\n私泣いてお父さんに当たったんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...When I transferred schools and had to be apart from you, I cried and lashed out at my father."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "大嫌いだって",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I told him I hated him."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "すっごく悲しそうな顔してね。そうか、とだけ言って、\n私の部屋を出ていって……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "He looked so sad. He barely said a word and left my room..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "次の日、冷蔵庫を開けたら、白い箱が入ってた。\n中身は私が大好きなケーキ屋さんのケーキ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The next day, I opened the refrigerator and found a white box. Inside was cake from my favorite bakery."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "その時思いだしたの。\n大嫌いって言った時に、その箱持ってたなって",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's when I remembered that he was holding that box when I shouted at him..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……渡せなかったんだなって",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...He had intended to give it me that day."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ごめんなさい、って言わなきゃいけない気がして、\nお父さんの部屋のドアをそっと開けたらね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I felt like I needed to apologize, so I quietly opened the door to his room..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "じっと入院してるお母さんの写真を見つめてて……\nなんだか、声をかけられなかった",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I saw that he was just sitting there, staring at a photo of my mother in the hospital... Seeing that, I couldn't bring myself to say anything."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それからお父さんは、よく言うようになったんだ。\nお前の好きなようにしていいんだぞって",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "After that, he started saying that I should do whatever makes me happy."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だから……まだ決めてない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So... I haven't made up my mind."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……そうなんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I see."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ライザは……進路はどう考えてるの？\nやっぱり、錬金術を使う道に？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What about you, Ryza? What are your plans? Will you pursue something related to alchemy?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん、そのつもり。まだ、はっきりとは\n決めてないんだけどね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah, that's the plan. Though I haven't decided on anything specific yet."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あーあ。やっぱり、ライザの学校に転校しようかな。\n今から錬金術を勉強して",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Maybe I should transfer to your school after all. I could start studying alchemy now..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おお？\u3000本気？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Really? You're serious?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ううん。冗談",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No, I'm just kidding."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だよね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I figured."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "半分は",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Half-kidding."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えっ！？\u3000半分本気ってこと！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wait, what!? You're half-serious!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふ、教えてあげない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe, I'm not telling."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええー？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh come on!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（ライザの言う通り、私は経営を学ぶのが好きで、\n\u3000今の進路は肌に合ってるんだと思う）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Ryza's right—I do enjoy studying business, and my current path probably suits me.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（でも、その道を進むということは、\n\u3000ライザとは一緒に居られないということで……）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(But choosing that path means I can't be with Ryza...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（どうして両方を取ることはできないんだろう）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Why can't I have both?)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（……そっか。きっとお父さんも）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I see... I bet my father...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（こんな気持ちだったんだろうな）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Felt the same way.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]